  {sig:'设置图标按钮的文本内容', desc:'<span class="desctile"><span class="status-badge">ƒ :</span>iconButton.setText(targetId, text)</b></span>更新 span 元素的文本，若不存在则自动创建 span 并插入到图标后面。',params:[{n:'targetId',t:'string',d:'图标按钮控件 ID'},{n:'text',t:'string',d:'按钮文本'}],ret:'boolean — 是否成功',exApi:"webviewBridge.api.iconButton.setText('iconButton_1', '[SAVE] 保存');",exCmd:'{\n  "command": "iconButton.setText",\n  "targetId": "iconButton_1",\n  "text": "保存"\n}'},
  {sig:'获取图标元素的 outerHTML', desc:'<span class="desctile"><span class="status-badge">ƒ :</span>iconButton.getIconHtml(targetId)</b></span>优先查找 i、svg、img 等图标元素（第一个非 SPAN 子元素），返回其 outerHTML。',params:[{n:'targetId',t:'string',d:'图标按钮控件 ID'}],ret:'string — 图标 HTML',exApi:"var icon = webviewBridge.api.iconButton.getIconHtml('iconButton_1');\nconsole.log('图标:', icon);",exCmd:'{\n  "command": "iconButton.getIconHtml",\n  "targetId": "iconButton_1"\n}'},
  {sig:'设置图标按钮的图标', desc:'<span class="desctile"><span class="status-badge">ƒ :</span>iconButton.setIconHtml(targetId, html)</b></span>移除旧图标元素，在 span 前面插入新的图标 HTML（支持 SVG/emoji/占位符）。',params:[{n:'targetId',t:'string',d:'图标按钮控件 ID'},{n:'html',t:'string',d:'图标 HTML'}],ret:'boolean — 是否成功',exApi:"// 设置 emoji 图标\nwebviewBridge.api.iconButton.setIconHtml('iconButton_1', '\\u{1F4BE}');\n\n// 设置  SVG 图标\nwebviewBridge.api.iconButton.setIconHtml('iconButton_1', '<svg>...</svg>');",exCmd:'{\n  "command": "iconButton.setIconHtml",\n  "targetId": "iconButton_1",\n  "html": "💾"\n}'}
]);

addDoc('imagebox', [
  {sig:'获取图片框的图片源地址', desc:'<span class="desctile"><span class="status-badge">ƒ :</span>imageBox.getSrc(targetId)</b></span>若无 img 元素则返回空字符串。',params:[{n:'targetId',t:'string',d:'图片框控件 ID'}],ret:'string — 图片 URL',exApi:"var src = webviewBridge.api.imageBox.getSrc('imageBox_1');\nconsole.log('图片地址:', src);",exCmd:'{\n  "command": "imageBox.getSrc",\n  "targetId": "imageBox_1"\n}'},
  {sig:'设置图片框的图片源地址', desc:'<span class="desctile"><span class="status-badge">ƒ :</span>imageBox.setSrc(targetId, url)</b></span>若无 img 元素则自动创建一个并设置默认样式。',params:[{n:'targetId',t:'string',d:'图片框控件 ID'},{n:'url',t:'string',d:'图片 URL'}],ret:'boolean — 是否成功',exApi:"webviewBridge.api.imageBox.setSrc('imageBox_1', 'https://example.com/photo.jpg');",exCmd:'{\n  "command": "imageBox.setSrc",\n  "targetId": "imageBox_1",\n  "url": "https://example.com/photo.jpg"\n}'},
  {sig:'获取图片的填充模式', desc:'<span class="desctile"><span class="status-badge">ƒ :</span>imageBox.getFit(targetId)</b></span>从 data-fit 属性或 style.objectFit 读取，默认为 "cover"。若 img 不存在返回空。',params:[{n:'targetId',t:'string',d:'图片框控件 ID'}],ret:'string — fill|contain|cover|none|scale-down',exApi:"var fit = webviewBridge.api.imageBox.getFit('imageBox_1');\nconsole.log('填充模式:', fit);",exCmd:'{\n  "command": "imageBox.getFit",\n  "targetId": "imageBox_1"\n}'},
  {sig:'设置图片的填充模式', desc:'<span class="desctile"><span class="status-badge">ƒ :</span>imageBox.setFit(targetId, fitMode)</b></span>若无 img 元素则自动创建。支持 fill、contain、cover、none-top-left、none-center。',params:[{n:'targetId',t:'string',d:'图片框控件 ID'},{n:'fitMode',t:'string',d:'fill | contain | cover | none-top-left | none-center'}],ret:'boolean — 是否成功',exApi:"// 设置填充模式\nwebviewBridge.api.imageBox.setFit('imageBox_1', 'contain');\n\n// 完整覆盖\nwebviewBridge.api.imageBox.setFit('imageBox_1', 'cover');",exCmd:'{\n  "command": "imageBox.setFit",\n  "targetId": "imageBox_1",\n  "fitMode": "contain"\n}'}
